{"rev":13,"ts":"2026-10-29T22:04:22.085746003+00:00","fields":{"__previous_part_content__":"Previous Part: [02](02-session-intake-managed-workspace.md) | Next Part: [04](04-revision-bound-approval.md)\n\n# 03 — Granular Mission planning operations\n\n## Outcome\n\nReplace generic client-side lifecycle chores with Mission-owned granular\noperations to create, read, update, order, and remove waypoints and to\ngenerate a coherent current plan from goal, requirements, evidence, and\nwaypoints.\n\n## Non-goal\n\nDo not publish a requester approval, execute a waypoint, or expose the final\nMCP names/transport yet.\n\n## Inputs and implementation boundary\n\nUse W1's abstractions and W2's intake/workspace identity. Preserve source,\nrevision, and evidence provenance; failures use the envelope proposed in\n[ARTIFACTS.md](ARTIFACTS.md#settled-design-notes-proposals-not-current-apis).\n\nUse stable IDs and expected revision on every mutation. Removing an unfinished\nwaypoint with references/dependents is rejected with a report unless the\nsame explicit operation supplies their valid replacement; never silently\ndrop edges. Completed/result-bearing waypoints remain retained history.\nReordering must preserve Mission's existing serial predecessor contract.\nCreation uses native-v2/typed-v3 complete outcome plans; no silent legacy\ndefault or synthesized requester requirements.\n\nExpose goal/requirements/evidence updates and a plan-prepare/read operation,\nnot only waypoint text edits. The review view includes canonical references,\nvalidation/review status, non-goals and plan/evidence identities. Every\nsuccessful edit regenerates the coherent current view as one publication\ntransaction; rejected edits preserve previous authoritative/generated bytes.\n\n## Expected post-state and validation\n\nMission service operations create/edit/remove a granular waypoint and return a\ndeterministic generated plan whose source references include goal,\nrequirements, and evidence. Invalid waypoint ids and stale revisions return\nstructured errors without partial writes.\n\nFuture target: `cd workflow-tools && cargo test -p mission`; include\ndeterministic plan, stale-write no-change, and missing-waypoint cases.\n\n## Checkpoint\n\nCommit service/API behavior and tests after the target passes.\n\n","__previous_part_id__":"82dabdc2-d314-4bf4-be4e-44e0162e6027","component":"mission.native-planning.plan-operations","depends_on":["55c99751-2801-42ef-bc29-7e3d01d6f4ca"],"linked":["921335e1-ac41-4217-b86c-e582eb0762b9"],"parts":[{"id":"6e67fbe0-9771-4693-8740-38a3baade4a1","kind":"requirements","path":"parts/requirements.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:39.294971947Z"},{"id":"82dabdc2-d314-4bf4-be4e-44e0162e6027","kind":"design","path":"parts/design.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:39.363165066Z"},{"id":"e02ae33f-12a7-4fce-9562-5a1ecb1007c6","kind":"examples","path":"parts/examples.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:39.434547727Z"},{"id":"7e781a12-5bdf-40f4-b9ab-bd86b2f351b6","kind":"acceptance_criteria","path":"parts/acceptance-criteria.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:39.507781083Z"},{"id":"8ca66fe6-c5a6-400e-8f15-eadc73090c26","kind":"validation","path":"parts/validation.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:39.581884144Z"},{"id":"73627ed0-4521-4e83-8a2f-74f28f0fcf2f","kind":"notes","path":"parts/notes.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:39.658650890Z"},{"id":"18bae0cf-2756-4206-b7aa-8fddbdf1af18","kind":"objective","path":"parts/objective.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T22:00:43.376178904Z"}],"priority":"high","refs":[{"kind":"spec","urn":"ce://default/spec/c3385d21-983e-4fb5-92f7-2a6ad757677a","note":"Owning native planning contract"}],"related_specs":"c3385d21-983e-4fb5-92f7-2a6ad757677a","state":"planning","title":"[mission-native][W3] Granular Mission Plan Mutation and Coherent Projection","type":"feature"}}
